Here, we observe that $3^4 \equiv 1 \pmod{5}$. Hence, every fourth power of 3 will yield a remainder of 1 when divided by 5. Given that 2040 is divisible by 4 (since $2040 = 4 \times 510$), we can express $3^{2040}$ as:
